      "text": "Postpartum timing:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " contact with a maternal care provider within the first 3 weeks postpartum, then ongoing care as needed, with a comprehensive postpartum visit no later than 12 weeks after birth."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
